name: sim.setBufferProperty
description: Sets a buffer property
luaSynopsis: sim.setBufferProperty(int target, string propertyName, bytes propertyState, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: sim.setBufferProperty(int target, string propertyName, buffer propertyState, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: setBufferProperty, class: object, file: object_setBufferProperty.method
